<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Application for Refund of Tuition and Fees Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { font-family: "Liberation Sans", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }

  /* Logo area */
  .logo-area {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .logo-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    border: 3px solid #e87722;
  }
  .logo-famu {
    background-color: #2e7d32;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-family: "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .logo-divider {
    width: 4px;
    background-color: #e87722;
  }
  .logo-text {
    background-color: #fff;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .logo-text span {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    font-family: "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .logo-text .highlight {
    color: #2e7d32;
  }

  /* Title section */
  .title-section {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .title-section h1 {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-family: "Liberation Serif", Georgia, serif;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }
  .title-section p {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-family: "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .title-section a {
    color: #1a0dab;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* Form fields */
  .form-section {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .field-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .field-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 4px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .field-label {
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .field-underline {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 80px;
    height: 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding-bottom: 1px;
  }
  .field-underline span {
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .sub-labels {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    padding-left: 0;
  }
  .sub-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #333;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Name row specifics */
  .name-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .name-last {
    flex: 1.2;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    height: 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding-bottom: 1px;
  }
  .name-first {
    flex: 1;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    height: 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding-bottom: 1px;
  }
  .name-sub {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    padding-left: 110px;
  }
  .name-sub-last {
    flex: 1.2;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #333;
  }
  .name-sub-first {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #333;
  }

  /* Reason section */
  .reason-section {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .reason-title {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .reason-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .checkbox {
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
    border: 1.5px solid #333;
    display: inline-block;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }
  .reason-text {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .other-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    width: 100%;
    height: 18px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .extra-lines {
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .extra-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    width: 100%;
    height: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  /* Notice section */
  .notice-section {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .notice-bold {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .notice-bold a {
    color: #1a0dab;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .notice-normal {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .notice-normal strong {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Signature section */
  .signature-section {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .sig-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 6px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .sig-label {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .sig-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    flex: 1;
    height: 18px;
  }

  /* Divider */
  .divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }

  /* Official use section */
  .official-section {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .official-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .approved-denied {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .approved-denied span {
    margin: 0 8px;
  }
  .approved-line {
    display: inline-block;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    width: 40px;
    margin-left: 4px;
  }
  .committee-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 30px;
  }
  .committee-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 6px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .committee-label {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .committee-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    flex: 1;
    height: 18px;
  }

  /* Financial Aid row */
  .fin-aid-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .fin-aid-label {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .fin-checkbox-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-left: 4px;
  }
  .fin-checkbox {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border: 1.5px solid #333;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .fin-option {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <!-- Logo -->
  <div class="logo-area">
    <div class="logo-box">
      <div class="logo-famu">FAMU</div>
      <div class="logo-divider"></div>
      <div class="logo-text">
        <span>Florida</span>
        <span><span class="highlight">Agricultural</span> and</span>
        <span>Mechanical</span>
        <span>University</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Title -->
  <div class="title-section">
    <h1>Application for Refund of Tuition and Fees Form</h1>
    <p>Student Financial Services<br>
    FHAC Suite G7<br>
    <span data-field="university_city_state">{{ university_city_state }}</span><br>
    Phone: <span data-field="university_phone">{{ university_phone }}</span> &nbsp;-&nbsp; Fax: <span data-field="university_fax">{{ university_fax }}</span> &nbsp;-&nbsp; Email: <a href="#"><span data-field="university_email">{{ university_email }}</span></a></p>
  </div>

  <!-- Student Info -->
  <div class="form-section">
    <!-- Name row -->
    <div class="name-row">
      <span class="field-label">Print Full Name:</span>
      <div class="name-last">
        <span data-field="last_name">{{ last_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <span style="font-size:13px;">,</span>
      <div class="name-first">
        <span data-field="first_name">{{ first_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <span class="field-label" style="margin-left:10px;">Student ID:</span>
      <div class="field-underline" style="min-width:140px;">
        <span data-field="student_id">{{ student_id }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="name-sub">
      <div class="name-sub-last">(Last)</div>
      <div style="width:6px;"></div>
      <div class="name-sub-first">(First)</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Term/Year and Email row -->
    <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
      <div class="field-group">
        <span class="field-label">Term/Year:</span>
        <div class="field-underline">
          <span data-field="term_year">{{ term_year }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="field-group" style="flex:1.4;">
        <span class="field-label">Email Address:</span>
        <div class="field-underline" style="min-width:160px;">
          <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Phone and Financial Aid row -->
    <div class="field-row">
      <div class="field-group">
        <span class="field-label">Phone Number:</span>
        <div class="field-underline">
          <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fin-aid-group" style="flex:1.2; margin-left:20px;">
        <span class="fin-aid-label">Financial Aid Received?</span>
        <div class="fin-checkbox-group">
          <div class="fin-checkbox"></div>
          <span class="fin-option">YES</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fin-checkbox-group" style="margin-left:14px;">
          <div class="fin-checkbox"></div>
          <span class="fin-option">NO</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Reason for Refund -->
  <div class="reason-section">
    <div class="reason-title">Reason for Refund Request (please check one)</div>

    <div class="reason-item">
      <div class="checkbox"></div>
      <div class="reason-text">Illness of a student of such severity or duration, as confirmed in writing by a physician, to preclude completion of the course(s).</div>
    </div>
    <div class="reason-item">
      <div class="checkbox"></div>
      <div class="reason-text">Death of the student or death in the immediate family (parent, spouse, child, or sibling).</div>
    </div>
    <div class="reason-item">
      <div class="checkbox"></div>
      <div class="reason-text">Involuntary call to active military duty.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="reason-item">
      <div class="checkbox"></div>
      <div class="reason-text">A situation in which the University in in error.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="reason-item">
      <div class="checkbox"></div>
      <div class="reason-text">
        Other:<div class="other-line"><span data-field="other_reason">{{ other_reason }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="extra-lines">
      <div class="extra-line"><span data-field="additional_notes_1">{{ additional_notes_1 }}</span></div>
      <div class="extra-line"><span data-field="additional_notes_2">{{ additional_notes_2 }}</span></div>
      <div class="extra-line"><span data-field="additional_notes_3">{{ additional_notes_3 }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Notice -->
  <div class="notice-section">
    <p class="notice-bold">Formal application must be made for a refund or other appeal action. This form must be submitted (with supporting documentation) to Student Financial Services at <a href="#"><span data-field="notice_email">{{ notice_email }}</span></a> within six (6) months of the close of the semester in which the refund or other appeal action is applicable.</p>
    <p class="notice-normal"><strong>Please note:</strong> A separate committee from the Retroactive Withdrawal Committee will consider your application for tuition refund. You will be notified via mail upon the decision of the committee.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Student Signature -->
  <div class="signature-section">
    <div class="sig-group" style="flex:1.5;">
      <span class="sig-label">Student's Signature:</span>
      <div class="sig-line"><span data-field="student_signature">{{ student_signature }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sig-group" style="flex:1;">
      <span class="sig-label">Date:</span>
      <div class="sig-line"><span data-field="student_signature_date">{{ student_signature_date }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Divider -->
  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- Official Use Only -->
  <div class="official-section">
    <div class="official-title">FOR OFFICIAL USE ONLY</div>
    <div class="approved-denied">
      Approved <span class="approved-line"><span data-field="approved_value">{{ approved_value }}</span></span>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      Denied <span class="approved-line"><span data-field="denied_value">{{ denied_value }}</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="committee-row">
      <div class="committee-group" style="flex:1.5;">
        <span class="committee-label">Committee Signature:</span>
        <div class="committee-line"><span data-field="committee_signature">{{ committee_signature }}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="committee-group" style="flex:1;">
        <span class="committee-label">Date:</span>
        <div class="committee-line"><span data-field="committee_date">{{ committee_date }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>